  m_Name: 04_Kalaw_Teach
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueNode
  speakerName: Kalaw
  speakerPortrait: {fileID: 0}
  dialogueText: 'Look at the morning sun shining over the tiled roofs of Calle Crisologo.

    In
    Ilokano, ''naimbag a bigat'' means ''good morning.''

    You can use it when
    greeting someone earlier in the day.

    For example, you can use it when greeting
    vendors as they begin their morning.

    Listen carefully: naimbag a bigat.

    Now,
    try saying ''naimbag a bigat'' yourself.'
